# Do not hardcode an example Render hostname: a real deployed backend is required.
# For GitHub Pages, set repository variable VITE_WEBSOCKET_URL to the actual
# Render service WSS URL. The deploy workflow injects it during the frontend build.
# For a manual build, uncomment and replace this example, then rebuild:
# VITE_WEBSOCKET_URL=wss://YOUR-ACTUAL-SERVICE.onrender.com
